Third-party methods and data
----------------------------
This repository contains no third-party datasets. The code reads the following
free sources at run time. Their terms apply to the data, not to this code.

- FAO-56 (Allen, R.G., Pereira, L.S., Raes, D., Smith, M., 1998. Crop
  evapotranspiration, FAO Irrigation and Drainage Paper 56). The method
  (equations and procedures) is implemented; no FAO text or tables are copied.

- NASA/USGS Landsat Collection 2 Level 2 (public domain). Read through the
  Microsoft Planetary Computer STAC catalogue.

- ESA Copernicus Sentinel-2 (free and open). Read through the Earth Search
  catalogue on AWS. Attribution: "Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data".

- Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com). Data is licensed CC BY 4.0; attribution
  is required: "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com". The free API is for
  non-commercial use only (see https://open-meteo.com/en/terms); commercial
  use requires one of their paid API plans. Check the current terms before
  any commercial deployment.

